# --- Installers setup.py downloads into this folder ---
# The pinned Ollama installer is 1.22 GB and lands in the repo root. Untracked
# it merely clutters `git status`; committed, GitHub rejects the push for
# exceeding the 100 MB blob limit, which is a confusing way to find out.
OllamaSetup.exe
*.exe

